#
# The meta surface (ORG-011, ADR-0015): the files that define the evidence. A PR touching any of
# them needs a maintainer's approval (ruleset: "Require review from Code Owners", 0 required
# approvals otherwise). Everything not listed merges on the required evidence checks alone
# (ORG-009). There is deliberately no `*` default owner.
#
# Field-level rules that CODEOWNERS cannot express (requirement `status` and `verified_by_gate`
# anywhere; `statement`/`acceptance`, where values and tolerances live, in PHY.md and NUM.md) are
# enforced by the ratchet check (tools/ratchet.py, TST-006) instead.
#
# Owners must match .github/governance/maintainers.txt (tools/tests/test_governance.py).
# Order does not matter here: every pattern has the same owners.

